#: ../../source/docs/raspberry-pi-via-mavlink.rst:5
#: 77a12a110923486e91facb21a8a59353
msgid "Communicating with Raspberry Pi via MAVLink"
msgstr "通过 MAVLink 与 Raspberry Pi 通信"

#: ../../source/docs/raspberry-pi-via-mavlink.rst:7
#: 0c79e638d9174a5c8e5222a6ada7fc20
msgid ""
"This page explains how to connect and configure a Raspberry Pi (RPi) so "
"that it is able to communicate with a flight controller using the MAVLink"
" protocol over a serial connection. This can be used to perform "
"additional tasks such as image recognition which simply cannot be done by"
" the flight controller due to the memory requirements for storing images."
msgstr ""
"本页面介绍如何连接和配置 Raspberry Pi（RPi），使其能够通过串口连接使用 MAVLink "
"协议与飞行控制器通信。此方案可用于执行图像识别等附加任务——这类任务因图像存储的内存需求而无法直接在飞行控制器上完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/raspberry-pi-via-mavlink.rst:15
#: 00ba4ee376254296b0fd988041a67aca
msgid "Connecting the Flight controller and RPi Hardware"
msgstr "连接飞行控制器和 RPi 硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/raspberry-pi-via-mavlink.rst:20
#: 1ccce1652d36429eb6bb4a03358d991d
msgid ""
"Connect the flight controller's TELEM2 port to the RPi's Ground, TX and "
"RX pins as shown in the image above. More details on the individual RPi's"
" pin functions can be found `here <http://elinux.org/RPi_Low-"
"level_peripherals>`__."
msgstr ""
"按上图所示，将飞行控制器的 TELEM2 端口连接到 RPi 的 Ground、TX 和 RX 引脚。有关各 RPi 引脚功能的更多详情，请参阅 "
"`此处 <http://elinux.org/RPi_Low-level_peripherals>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/raspberry-pi-via-mavlink.rst:25
#: e6eec13d3a594d44b359a7580f112be3
msgid ""
"The RPi can be powered by connecting +5V source to the +5V pin  **or** "
"from USB in."
msgstr "RPi 可通过将 +5V 电源连接到 +5V 引脚 **或** 通过 USB 供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/raspberry-pi-via-mavlink.rst:27
#: a06f47b545c044d5aa661a7b4c591994
msgid ""
"Addon boards such as the `Pi-Connect <https://www.rpanion.com/product/pi-"
"connect-lite-v2/>`__ can simplify the connection of the RPi by providing "
"a power supply and telemetry port."
msgstr ""
"`Pi-Connect <https://www.rpanion.com/product/pi-connect-lite-v2/>`__ "
"等扩展板可提供电源和数传端口，从而简化 RPi 的连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/raspberry-pi-via-mavlink.rst:32
#: c8ab368518e5420dbf75ebf4907f314e
msgid ""
"Depending on the model of RPi used and internal/external peripherals "
"used, +5V power requirements can vary from 80mA to close to 2.5A. The "
"power budget for the particular system configuration should be assessed "
"to determine the requirements for the +5V supply current. It is usually "
"not recommended that +5v be supplied via the flight controller's TELEM "
"port connector."
msgstr ""
"根据所用 RPi 型号及内外部外设的不同，+5V 功耗需求从 80mA 到接近 2.5A 不等。应根据具体系统配置评估功耗预算，以确定 +5V "
"供电电流的要求。通常不建议通过飞行控制器的 TELEM 端口连接器供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/raspberry-pi-via-mavlink.rst:37
#: e82a0f937604423fa9a0f22e26a02189
msgid "Setting up the flight controller"
msgstr "配置飞行控制器"

#: ../../source/docs/raspberry-pi-via-mavlink.rst:39
#: 38268fd28feb4623ad87ccfca6332a44
msgid ""
"Connect to the flight controller with a ground station (i.e. Mission "
"Planner) and set the following parameters:"
msgstr "使用地面站（如 Mission Planner）连接飞行控制器，并设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/raspberry-pi-via-mavlink.rst:41
#: 37aa2f3af3b044ab9842a2a082d69687
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <copter:SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 2 (the default) to "
"enable MAVLink 2 on the serial port."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <copter:SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 2（默认值），在串口上启用 MAVLink"
" 2。"

#: ../../source/docs/raspberry-pi-via-mavlink.rst:42
#: a9891eb8423e4a5b9e11bedc719ddc84
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <copter:SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 921 so the flight controller "
"can communicate with the RPi at 921600 baud."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <copter:SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 921，使飞行控制器能以 921600 波特率与 RPi "
"通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/raspberry-pi-via-mavlink.rst:43
#: a3110f83b0894ec0b355c1680f1f0400
msgid ""
":ref:`LOG_BACKEND_TYPE <copter:LOG_BACKEND_TYPE>` = 3 if you are using "
"APSync to stream the dataflash log files to the RPi"
msgstr ""
":ref:`LOG_BACKEND_TYPE <copter:LOG_BACKEND_TYPE>` = 3，若使用 APSync 将 "
"dataflash 日志文件流式传输到 RPi"

