msgstr "连接 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/raspberry-pi-via-mavlink.rst:216
#: 9fd489ddf53d452381f8ebd08ea5778a
msgid ""
"The flight controller will respond to MAVLink commands received through "
"Telemetry 1 and Telemetry 2 ports (see image at top of this page) meaning"
" that both the RPi and the regular ground station (i.e. Mission planner, "
"etc) can be connected. In addition it is possible to connect the Mission "
"Planner to the MAVProxy application running on the RPi :ref:`similar to "
"how it is done for SITL <setting-up-sitl-on-"
"windows_connecting_with_the_mission_planner>`."
msgstr ""
"飞控将响应通过数传1和数传2端口接收到的 MAVLink 命令（见本页顶部图片），这意味着 RPi 和常规地面站（如 Mission "
"Planner 等）均可连接。此外，也可以将 Mission Planner 连接到运行在 RPi 上的 MAVProxy "
"应用，:ref:`方式与 SITL 类似 <setting-up-sitl-on-"
"windows_connecting_with_the_mission_planner>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/raspberry-pi-via-mavlink.rst:222
